<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.9">
<l>kuṉṟāṭu koḻumukilpōl kuvaḷaikaḷpōl kuraikaṭalpōl</l>
<l>niṉṟāṭu kaṇamayilpōl niṟamuṭaiya neṭumālūr</l>
<l>kuṉṟūṭu poḻilnuḻaintu koṭiyiṭaiyār mulaiyaṇavi</l>
<l>maṉṟūṭu teṉṟalumām matiḷaraṅka meṉpatuvē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of Neṭumāl whose complexion is</l>
<l rend="indent">like a flock of dancing peacocks,</l>
<l rend="indent">like the fertile clouds that dance [around] the hills,</l>
<l rend="indent">like the Kuvaḷai flowers and the roaring sea,</l>
<l>is called walled Araṅkam</l>
<l rend="indent">where the south wind [blows] at the crossroads,</l>
<l rend="indent">creeps through hill and grove,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] embraced the breasts of ladies with creeper[-thin] waists.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
